                           <p><material key="marmor">White marble</material> 
                              <objectType>sarcophagus</objectType> body: 
                              <dimensions><height unit="metre">0.23</height> <width unit="metre">2.50</width> <depth unit="metre">0952</depth></dimensions>. 
                              On the front, Nikai on either end hold garlands, while Erotes
                              support a tabula ansata; there are two unfinished busts in the lunettes above the garland swags (a man on
